   "he": "תְּרוּמוֹת יֵרָקְבוּ אָמַר רַב חִסְדָּא לֹא שָׁנוּ אֶלָּא תְּרוּמָה בְּיַד יִשְׂרָאֵל אֲבָל תְּרוּמָה בְּיַד כֹּהֵן כֵּיוָן דְּמָמוֹנֵיהּ הוּא תִּשָּׂרֵף",
   "en": "§ The baraita continues: «Terumot must» be left to «decay. Rav Ḥisda says:» The Sages «taught» this «only» with regard to «teruma» that is still «in the possession of an Israelite,» who has not yet given it to a priest. «But» concerning «teruma» that is already «in the possession of a priest» who lives in the idolatrous city, «since it is his property, it shall be burned.»"
  }
